ned}\n$$\n\nwhere $0\\le t\\le 1.$\n\nComputing $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t},$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3t)=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=7\\left(x+\\sqrt{3y}\\right)$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =7\\left((2-2t)+\\sqrt{3(3t)}\\right)\\\\  & =7\\left(2-2t+3\\sqrt{t}\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now evaluate the integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(r(t))\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =7\\left({\\int }_{0}^{1}(2-2t+3\\sqrt{t})\\cdot 3\\cdot \\text{d}t\\right)\\\\  & =7\\left(3{\\int }_{0}^{1}(2-2t+3{t}^{1/2})\\,\\text{d}t\\right)\\\\  & =7\\left(3{[2t-{t}^{2}+2{t}^{3/2}]}_{0}^{1}\\right)\\\\  & =7\\left(3[(2(1)-(1)^{2}+2(1)^{3/2})-(0)]\\right)\\\\  & =7\\left(3(3)\\right)\\\\  & =7\\left(9\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553795 1080 "7\\left(8\\right)" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553795 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553795 1083 #uuid "d6390df0-7054-59fa-85ef-6b7ce29f20c0" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553796 1080 "7\\left(5\\right)" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553796 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553796 1083 #uuid "d7a561cd-3c03-570c-916f-6173a02ece12" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553797 1080 "7\\left(\\frac{e}{2}-1\\right)" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553797 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553797 1083 #uuid "e4284b1e-3a30-52a4-94c0-1caf9580e943" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553798 1080 "9\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)" 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553798 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535992 17592186045443 true] [17592186553798 1083 #uuid "ed8388c4-b4b0-5c49-a3e6-c0618fd0f8f7" 13194139535992 175